GET {{baseUrl}}/api/estadisticas/trabajos-mes/

### =====================================================
### IA / INTELIGENCIA ARTIFICIAL
### =====================================================

### Busqueda semantica (RAG Search)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ia/search/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "inteligencia artificial en educacion",
  "limit": 5,
  "filters": {}
}

### Respuesta RAG con contexto
POST {{baseUrl}}/ia/rag/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "como aplicar machine learning en tesis?",
  "limit": 5,
  "filters": {}
}

### Analisis de tendencias (requiere ser Administrador)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ia/analytics/trends/?clusters=6
Authorization: Token {{token}}

